<newsitem itemid="121750" id="root" date="1996-10-16" xml:lang="en">
<title>NETHERLANDS: AOT Q3 PROFIT 3.9 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>AOT Q3 PROFIT 3.9 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.93 vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Net profit			     3.9  vs   3.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name is AOT NV.</p>
<p>First nine months 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.43 vs   2.18</p>
<p>    Net profit			    14.4  vs   7.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Stock broker and options trader AOT said turnover at</p>
<p>the options and stock markets remained at a high level in the</p>
<p>third quarter of 1996 but added that bonds trading was an</p>
<p>exception. Turnover at unit AOT Money Brokers developed more</p>
<p>favourably than in the year-ago period, AOT said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
